summary:
  Stop looks at what plays, what is cast, ordered, parked or kept, and not
  at a search result whose address stands while nothing of it sounds yet.

history:
  On the relay road a tried-out result's player starts only when the tap
  is up, one to four seconds after the click. A Stop inside that window
  answered "none", and the station came up and played: -9.9 dBFS on the
  sink a second and a half after the press.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TransportLogic.js

find:
                  || pausedFile === true || audition === true) ? "stop" : "none";

replace:
                  || pausedFile === true) ? "stop" : "none";

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_transportlogic.qml::test_stop_and_pause_take_down_an_audition_that_is_on_its_way
  and tests/qml/tst_transportroads.qml::test_stop_half_a_second_into_an_audition_is_silence.
  Line-neutral.
